<li><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-family: 'PingFang TC Regular';">【中文名】：羅氏鮮</span><span style="font-family: 'PingFang TC Regular';">、</span><span style="font-family: 'PingFang TC Regular';">羅鮮子</span></span></li>
<li><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-family: 'PingFang TC Regular';">【成分含量】：Orlistat 120 mg</span></span></li>
